comment12.text=\r\n\ A\u00F1ade\ una\ rueda\ al\ stock\ del\ almac\u00E9n.\r\n\r\n\ @param\ rueda\ rueda\ a\ registrar\r\n
comment13.params=
comment13.target=java.util.List\ consultarRueda()
comment13.text=\r\n\ @return\ lista\ de\ ruedas\ en\ stock\r\n
